step 2   That leaves 1, too few for another group.   [1153 − 1152 = 1]
step 3   So the quotient is 384.
miss     gave-remainder = 1   That is what was left over. The question asks how many groups.
miss     rounded-up = 385   The last 1 cannot make another group of 3."
`;

